    "text": "\u00d0EOS BOC SCEAL TO WIOGORA CEASTRE.\n\u00c6lfred kyning hate\u00f0 gretan W\u00e6rfer\u00f0 biscep his wordum luflice & freondlice;\n& \u00f0e cy\u00f0an hate \u00f0\u00e6t me com swi\u00f0e oft on gemynd, hwelce wiotan iu w\u00e6ron giond Angelcynn, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge\n& hu ges\u00e6liglica tida \u00f0a w\u00e6ron giond Angelcynn;\n& hu \u00f0a kyningas \u00f0e \u00f0one onwald h\u00e6fdon \u00f0\u00e6s folces on \u00f0am dagum Gode & his \u00e6rendwrecum\n& hie \u00e6g\u00f0er ge hiora sibbe ge hiora siodo ge hiora onweald innanbordes wel gehioldon, & eac ut hiora\n& hu him \u00f0a speow \u00e6g\u00f0er ge mid wige ge mid wisdome;\n& eac \u00f0a godcundan hadas hu giorne hie w\u00e6ron \u00e6g\u00f0er ge ymb lare ge ymb liornunga, ge ymb ealle \u00f0a\n& hu man utanbordes wisdom & lare hieder on lond sohte, & hu we hie nu sceoldon ute begietan gif we\nSw\u00e6 cl\u00e6ne hio w\u00e6s o\u00f0feallenu on Angelcynne \u00f0\u00e6t swi\u00f0e feawa w\u00e6ron behionan Humbre \u00f0e hiora\n& ic wene \u00f0\u00e6tte noht monige begiondan Humbre n\u00e6ren.\nSw\u00e6 feawa hiora w\u00e6ron \u00f0\u00e6t ic fur\u00f0um anne anlepne ne m\u00e6g ge\u00f0encean besu\u00f0an Temese \u00f0a \u00f0a ic\nGode \u00e6lmihtegum sie \u00f0onc \u00f0\u00e6tte we nu \u00e6nigne on stal habba\u00f0 lareowa.\n& for\u00f0on ic \u00f0e bebiode \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u do sw\u00e6 ic geliefe \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u wille, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u \u00f0e \u00f0issa woruld\u00f0inga to \u00f0\u00e6m\nGe\u00f0enc hwelc witu us \u00f0a becomon for \u00f0isse worulde, \u00f0a \u00f0a we hit nohw\u00e6\u00f0er ne selfe ne lufodon ne eac\n\u00d0a ic \u00f0a \u00f0is eall gemunde \u00f0a gemunde ic eac hu ic geseah, \u00e6r\u00f0\u00e6m\u00f0e hit eall forhergod w\u00e6re &\nSwelce hie cw\u00e6den: Ure ieldran, \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0as stowa \u00e6r hioldon, hie lufodon wisdom & \u00f0urh \u00f0one hie\nHer mon m\u00e6g giet gesion hiora sw\u00e6\u00f0, ac we him ne cunnon \u00e6fterspyr